{"sectionId":"electro/redox","items":[{"id":"electro--redox-k001","sectionId":"electro/redox","unitId":"electro","subject":"chemistry","text":"산화는 전자 손실 및 산화수 증가, 환원은 전자 획득 및 산화수 감소이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"electro--redox-k002","sectionId":"electro/redox","unitId":"electro","subject":"chemistry","text":"산화제는 상대를 산화시키고 자신은 환원되며 환원제는 그 반대다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"electro--redox-k003","sectionId":"electro/redox","unitId":"electro","subject":"chemistry","text":"자유 원소 산화수는 0, 단원자 이온은 전하와 같다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"electro--redox-k004","sectionId":"electro/redox","unitId":"electro","subject":"chemistry","text":"H는 보통 +1(금속 수소화물 −1), O는 보통 −2(과산화물 −1, OF₂에서는 +2)이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"electro--redox-k005","sectionId":"electro/redox","unitId":"electro","subject":"chemistry","text":"산화수 합은 종의 전하와 같다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"electro--redox-k006","sectionId":"electro/redox","unitId":"electro","subject":"chemistry","text":"산성 반쪽반응 균형은 O를 H₂O, H를 H⁺, 전하를 e⁻로 맞추고 전자 수를 같게 해 합친다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"electro--redox-k007","sectionId":"electro/redox","unitId":"electro","subject":"chemistry","text":"염기성에서는 산성 방식으로 맞춘 뒤 H⁺에 해당하는 양의 OH⁻를 양변에 더해 물로 정리할 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"electro--redox-k008","sectionId":"electro/redox","unitId":"electro","subject":"chemistry","text":"불균등화는 같은 산화상태 종이 산화와 환원을 동시에 겪는 반응이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"electro--redox-k009","sectionId":"electro/redox","unitId":"electro","subject":"chemistry","text":"산화환원 적정은 전달 전자 수의 화학량론을 이용한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"electro--redox-k010","sectionId":"electro/redox","unitId":"electro","subject":"chemistry","text":"산화제는 전자를 받는다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"electro--redox-k011","sectionId":"electro/redox","unitId":"electro","subject":"chemistry","text":"산화수는 형식적 전자 배정이며 실제 부분전하와 다르다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"electro--redox-k012","sectionId":"electro/redox","unitId":"electro","subject":"chemistry","text":"산화환원 반응식의 질량과 전하를 모두 검사한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"electro--redox-k013","sectionId":"electro/redox","unitId":"electro","subject":"chemistry","text":"MnO₄⁻의 산성 환원 생성물은 전형적으로 Mn²⁺이고 조건에 따라 다르다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"electro--redox-k014","sectionId":"electro/redox","unitId":"electro","subject":"chemistry","text":"+6이다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]}]}